    message: 'IVX autonomous coder: raise DEFAULT_MAX_TOKEN_BUDGET 60k -> 200k. The 60k cap BLOCKED a legitimate PILOT-2->PILOT-3 LLM-driven change after 4 iterations (TOKEN_BUDGET_EXCEEDED: 71389/60000). The cost control worked correctly (blocked unbounded spend), but the cap was too tight for a real coding task that sends file previews to the model across up to 5 iterations. 200k is realistic. 25 tests still pass, tsc 0 errors.' },
